    <briefdescription>
<para>Per-thread counters tracking how much work the F4 reduction did. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="struct_n_c_f4_1_1_n_c_f4_stats_a2bf044b7bab2d8905f26886e5ff757af_1a2bf044b7bab2d8905f26886e5ff757af" kindref="member">numCancellations</ref></computeroutput> is the number of coefficient cancellations the reducer applied, and <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_n_c_f4_1_1_n_c_f4_stats_a06500bfdefd3591e70bf09aff711a09a_1a06500bfdefd3591e70bf09aff711a09a" kindref="member">numRows</ref></computeroutput> is the number of rows it processed. Stored thread-locally so the parallel build path can tally without contention. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
